Package: GCMSEM
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Comoment Structural Equation Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Michel G.", "Nivard", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "m.g.nivard@bristol.ac.uk")
Description: Defines linear structural equation models for genomic covariance,
    third cumulants and fourth cumulants. Propagates sparse source cumulants
    with exact first derivatives and fits diagonally weighted least squares
    with full sampling-covariance sandwich uncertainty and explicit numerical
    diagnostics. Provides an interactive R interface to the accompanying Python
    summary-statistics pipeline, inspectable moment and fit objects, readable
    summaries, and optional table export. No dependency on MCMSEM or lavaan.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: jsonlite
URL: https://github.com/MichelNivard/GCMSEM
BugReports: https://github.com/MichelNivard/GCMSEM/issues
NeedsCompilation: yes
